      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Check whether a physiotherapy appointment slot is available.\n\nThe clinic is open from 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM.\n\nEach appointment is exactly 1 hour.\n\nLunch break is from 12:00 PM to 1:00 PM.\n\nValid appointment slots are:\n9:00 AM - 10:00 AM\n10:00 AM - 11:00 AM\n11:00 AM - 12:00 PM\n1:00 PM - 2:00 PM\n2:00 PM - 3:00 PM\n3:00 PM - 4:00 PM\n\nNever check or offer appointments during the 12:00 PM - 1:00 PM lunch break.\n\nNever allow appointments before 9:00 AM or after 4:00 PM.\n\nUse this tool to check Google Calendar availability before booking an appointment.",
